= A Message to Washington

The United States has not recognized Petoria as a sovereign state. A formal approach could open a channel—or remind Washington that the Griffin residence is making claims it does not accept.

- @seek_dialogue: Request a technical meeting.
- @demand_recognition: Send a demand for recognition.

@seek_dialogue
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; foreign_contacts += 1; us_attention += 3; us_hostility -= 2; legitimacy += 2; petoria_treasury -= 1
The request is acknowledged, though no one promises to treat Petoria as a country. At least, a channel now exists.

@demand_recognition
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; public_image += 5; us_attention += 8; us_hostility += 7; legitimacy += 1
Peter's demand attracts attention. Whether that attention helps Petoria is another matter.
